			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Rename handle_call to Call for PascalCase compliance\n\nRename the async function handle_call to Call in APIBridgeImpl, following the PascalCase naming convention adopted across the Grove codebase. This aligns with the module PascalCase migration effort referenced in recent commits.\n\nConsistent with the LAND_DEV_LOG → Trace rename from the previous commit.",
